    "AI Notes": {
      "value": "Turkish graphic designer and art director based in London; BA Central Saint Martins 2018. Joined Zak Group the day after graduating; now listed as Art Director on the studio's people page (zak.group). Practice is language-led: treats words as objects, performers and places (profiled by It's Nice That); conceptual graphic and identity work with clients incl. FACT, Serpentine Galleries, Paco Rabanne. Seniority: Art Director, ~8 yrs experience (2018-2026), long tenure at one prestigious studio; Autonomy 4 estimate (operates at AD level, capable of leading projects independently within a studio context), hedged. Work Status Employed: Zak Group site lists her as Art Director (primary source); It's Nice That corroborates (secondary). No LinkedIn profile found after two searches. IG @aseltambay verified (bio matches, graphic-design grid). Partner-Dream referenced in Jonathan's clip note but no studio by that name confirmed; asked in Open Questions.",
